{"tool_name":"lama:-the-localization-microscopy-analyzer","contents":["neubias"],"fetched_metadata":{"neubias":{"body":[{"format":"basic_html","processed":"<p>LocAlization Microscopy Analyzer (LAMA) is a software tool that contains several well-established data post processing algorithms for single-molecule localization microscopy (SMLM) data. LAMA has implemented algorithms for cluster analysis, colocalization analysis, localization precision estimation and image registration. LAMA works with a graphical user interface (GUI), and accepts simple input data formats as supported by various single- molecule localization software tools.</p>","summary":"","value":"<p>LocAlization Microscopy Analyzer (LAMA) is a software tool that contains several well-established data post processing algorithms for single-molecule localization microscopy (SMLM) data. LAMA has implemented algorithms for cluster analysis, colocalization analysis, localization precision estimation and image registration. LAMA works with a graphical user interface (GUI), and accepts simple input data formats as supported by various single- molecule localization software tools.</p>\r\n"}],"changed":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2023-05-03T13:27:03+00:00"}],"created":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2016-07-12T14:13:42+00:00"}],"default_langcode":[{"value":true}],"attribution_instructions":[],"comments_2023":[],"free_tagging":[{"target_id":3599,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"9452479a-42da-42cf-a214-898c8df8025c","url":"/taxonomy/term/3599"}],"give_feedback_on_this_soft":[{"cid":0,"comment_count":0,"last_comment_name":null,"last_comment_timestamp":1505204840,"last_comment_uid":164,"status":2}],"has_author":[{"value":"Sebastian Malkush"},{"value":"Mike Heilemann"}],"has_biological_terms":[],"has_comparison":[],"has_documentation":[],"has_doi":[],"has_entry_curator":[{"target_id":32,"target_type":"user","target_uuid":"a940a720-3998-4cde-b29a-2cec8fce3b66","url":"/user/32"}],"has_function"